"P854529733" "Recall"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P140340534" "Recall was part of Powers division, and known for his superhuman eidetic memory. He has memorized the formula for Fixadyne, making him a very dangerous individual to have running around Paragon City."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
