// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4219321124" "Took me a while, but I tracked you down. I had to piece everything together that I had witnessed and then a pattern became clear."
// Answer Text :
"P1208768527" "Listen"
// Page MonologueP1 Text :
"P1743151451" "There was a connection between all these deaths I had seen. You kept your face hidden from the shopkeeper's surveilance cameras, and from the cameras inside that Crey lab."
// Answer Text :
"P3561758841" "Next"
// Page MonologueP2 Text :
"P641820098" "But I was able to get enough for a gait match to know that it was the same person in each incident."
// Page MonologueP3 Text :
"P1542593263" "That trick with the cell phone was cute, but I caught on soon enough. Then there was the evidence you planted on Archon Kruger. I had an eye on him for a while, my own spyware on the Council computers. When new records just started popping up, I figured something was about to go down."
// Page MonologueP4 Text :
"P1734594554" "I was close to you, but I needed to catch you red-handed, so I leaked the information I had about this Crusader here, hoping to draw you out. Worked like a charm. Now, I get to bring you in, and you can tell me all about who you work for."
// Answer Text :
"P2633257767" "Prepare to fight"
// Page MonologueP5 Text :
"P165037225" "Fight!"
// Answer Text :
"P982440896" "Attack"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3558472790" "No time for dead drop. I have to give you these orders in the clear. You ready?"
// AcceptString :
"P701890440" "Yes Major, I am ready. Shoot."
// SendOffString :
"P3774335944" "There is a guy, former Crusader from Praetoria, wants to blow up the new Powers division getting set up here on Primal Earth. Hero Corp was hired to arrest this man, but I made sure that that job was put into the hands of their C-level operatives, real buffoons. This gives Void Sanction a chance to strike the blow that Hero Corp isn't legally able to. First I need you to go and collect some explosives from a Council base then plant these in that damn Crusader's HQ. After you take down the Crusader, you can detonate the explosives and cover up your tracks."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1261938699" "<color deepskyblue>I Love It When A Plan Comes Together</color>"

